  "goodToKnow": "Der Gerichtsvollzieher (die Gerichtsvollzieherin) is a court bailiff who enforces judgments, mainly collecting debts by pfänden (seizing) valuables or carrying out evictions (Zwangsräumungen). The seizure seal stuck on goods is colloquially called der Kuckuck, after the eagle on older seals that people mocked as a cuckoo. From vollziehen (to execute) and das Gericht. The plural is the same."
